erous reaction that may be linked to Covid-19.\", \"urlToImage\": \"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/branded_news/11FB8/production/_111365637_gettyimages-1204264776-1.jpg\", \"url\": \"http://www.bbc.co.uk/news/health-52439005\", \"id\": \"bbc-news\", \"name\": \"BBC News\"}, {\"title\": \"Coronavirus LIVE Updates: India Sees Record Rise in Death Toll in 24 Hours, Cases Cross 28,000-Mark\", \"description\": \"Coronavirus Pandemic LIVE Updates: Thirty-three healthcare workers, including two doctors and 23 nursing staff, tested positive for Covid-19 at New Delhi's Max Hospital.\", \"urlToImage\": \"https://images.news18.com/ibnlive/uploads/2020/04/1587797183_kerala-coronavirus-hospital.jpg\", \"url\": \"https://www.news18.com/news/india/coronavirus-pandemic-live-updates-pm-narendra-modi-lockdown-maharashtra-us-vaccine-mumbai-india-cases-world-2593843.html\", \"id\": \"google-news-in\", \"name\": \"Google News (India)\"}, {\"title\": \"Donald Trump's big coronavirus sacrifice? Lunch.\", \"description\": \"President Donald Trump really, really didn't like a recent New York Times story that detailed his daily routine during the coronavirus pandemic -- including the fact that he \\\"arrives in the Oval Office these days as late as noon when he is usually in a sour m\\u2026\", \"urlToImage\": \"https://cdn.cnn.com/cnnnext/dam/assets/160802200507-donald-trump-on-plane-super-tease.jpg\", \"url\": \"http://us.cnn.com/2020/04/27/politics/donald-trump-coronavirus-pandemic-lunch/index.html\", \"id\": \"cnn\", \"name\": \"CNN\"}, {\"title\": \"White House may scale back coronavirus task force meetings soon, source says\", \"description\": \"The White House coronavirus task force may soon begin slowly scaling back its number of meetings, a source familiar with the decision told CNN, as President Donald Trump and Vice President Mike Pence schedule other events focused on reviving a stalled economy.\", \"urlToImage\": \"https://cdn.cnn.com/cnnnext/dam/assets/180625093716-01-trump-